  "body": "First signed contribution by **tosman** to the open phase-2 ceremony.\n\n- Contribution: `65cbe4db248743a1cca1b49414f4d98a0b882529a7da3b4593df2951b8312198`\n- Transcript: `551ba6e7b91b32169f1f44c42aea1fbd7216da783e4543628ccb3cb3fcb9dbeb`\n- Rust chain verification and SSH signature verification passed.\n- Operator-controlled contribution; not an independent participant.\n- Open ceremony, not final parameters. Contributions close at Bitcoin 970141; beacon at 970285.\n\n[Announcement published before contribution](https://github.com/tosnetwork/tos/releases/tag/shielded-pool-phase2-announcement-v2).\n\n[Contribution record and validation](https://github.com/tosnetwork/tos/blob/2afff9a3324fc94a4a42a087451c1e90b6510bb8/artifacts/phase2/CONTRIBUTION-1.md).\n\nThe archive contains only public ceremony files, the signed attestation, registered public key, announcement and verification evidence. No signing private key is included.\n\n\n\nPublication privacy correction: Git metadata and review paths were sanitized, and the contribution archive was repacked without personal owner or extended metadata. Original announcement and signed contribution file payloads are unchanged. The attached PRIVACY-PROVENANCE.json and its SSH signature map original commit IDs to the sanitized revisions. See [cleanup details](https://github.com/tosnetwork/tos/blob/feat/shielded-pool/artifacts/phase2/PRIVACY-CLEANUP.md).\n"
